    "name": "Slime Squadron: Harpy Raiders",
    "steam_appid": 2380070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide and stretch your slime squadrons in daring raids against the Harpy Empire!  Balance international opinion and the masses' clamoring for vengeance in a sky-spanning crusade to take back what is rightfully yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.poster.avif?t=1750575003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.webm?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.mp4?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raid the Harpies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime Army High Command has identified roughly <strong>10 major missions</strong> that requires your attention, and there is little time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight to the countless sky islands - some widely-known and well-mapped as strongholds of the Empire, while countless others are as ephemeral as the wind and seemingly as random.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.poster.avif?t=1750575003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.webm?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.mp4?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build up your Slime Squadrons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your fire-team with exotic slime types, then genetically modify them with potent mutagens. Your troops have entrusted their very forms to you, to be forged into the ultimate harpy-slaying weapon. Utilize and sacrifice them as necessary - its what they <span class=\"bb_strike\">were conscripted</span> signed up for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/25cd0edde7dd2c367402c1b83a18b895.avif?t=1750575003\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Campaign of Vengeance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slime race has been humiliated by the harpies' military ambitions, while human-dominated international media is far from sympathetic. Avenge your national pride and show the world that slimes are not pushovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/89fb1ec1a2329227c2a80182895c17d3.avif?t=1750575003\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And Remember...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ed6a8c26e35a37e10f90a809a3a08dff.webp?t=1750575003\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide and stretch your slime squadrons in daring raids against the Harpy Empire!  Balance international opinion and the masses' clamoring for vengeance in a sky-spanning crusade to take back what is rightfully yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.poster.avif?t=1750575003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.webm?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/e9ec988c5f16b12c33f0f98be23a342a.mp4?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raid the Harpies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime Army High Command has identified roughly <strong>10 major missions</strong> that requires your attention, and there is little time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight to the countless sky islands - some widely-known and well-mapped as strongholds of the Empire, while countless others are as ephemeral as the wind and seemingly as random.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.poster.avif?t=1750575003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.webm?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ac2d414308755870cad02d634b397852.mp4?t=1750575003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build up your Slime Squadrons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your fire-team with exotic slime types, then genetically modify them with potent mutagens. Your troops have entrusted their very forms to you, to be forged into the ultimate harpy-slaying weapon. Utilize and sacrifice them as necessary - its what they <span class=\"bb_strike\">were conscripted</span> signed up for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/25cd0edde7dd2c367402c1b83a18b895.avif?t=1750575003\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Campaign of Vengeance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slime race has been humiliated by the harpies' military ambitions, while human-dominated international media is far from sympathetic. Avenge your national pride and show the world that slimes are not pushovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/89fb1ec1a2329227c2a80182895c17d3.avif?t=1750575003\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And Remember...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/ed6a8c26e35a37e10f90a809a3a08dff.webp?t=1750575003\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Stick, stretch, squish and slide your way as a squad of slime soldiers raiding the Harpy Empire in Slime Squadron: Harpy Raiders, an outlandish role-playing platformer. Maybe cause some humanitarian catastrophes along the way. Glory to the Slime Army!",
